<item>
<title>Russia's war in Ukraine: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/ukraine/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-ukraine-2026-11-10T18:01:23.604Z</guid>
<pubDate>Tue, 10 Nov 2026 18:01:23 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Ukraine has launched a drone strike that killed a worker at the Zaporizhzhia nuclear power plant and attacked a missile-fuel plant in St Petersburg, while Russia has continued missile and drone attacks on Ukrainian power facilities and the Northern Bridge. Russia has begun rationing petrol after Ukrainian strikes damaged its second-largest refinery in Saratov, prompting Rosneft to cap sales, and a Russian FPV drone wounded three energy workers in Sumy Oblast. Leaked data indicate that more than 400,000 Russian soldiers have been killed in the war. Trilateral peace talks involving the United States, Russia and Ukraine are now underway in Abu Dhabi, and UCDP recorded 75,767 battle-related deaths in 2024.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/09/world/europe/ukraine-russia-peace-talks.html&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.un.org/feed/view/en/story/2026/11/1168761&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivwFBVV95cUxQTGdwSTdVbDNKcWFuM2ZVdk0zSmFHNkh2UFFLR1JQZnUzeXB3aFBWS1NDcTJWWWV3R1lxR2VseHRYdkpQX0xjRGFFekdiRUdQSVhYWktBTVV3TV90RHVhRUJGWHZ5XzllTTRQckZ6WG12MWxNZ2NTclBua3VHaWs4aHRnX2NZLXF0bjB6MF9kUzBRcVlBZzFPaTAwaFJXeXRqOUxDcm1YZHFpZEVFRm9rTDc1S3kyVDlxdGpDbUlOYw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.theguardian.com/world/live/2026/nov/10/ukraine-russia-war-us-talks-abu-dhabi-europe-latest-news-updates&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXkFVX3lxTE1xc3ljZTJWNDdveFBlV2R3MGxrai15SXpDNWtXb0FqYXZUMk5nTFZfMFhNdUdudHVWdmRmZWhGbVRFZjdFVl9jY2RFczdGb056RkRMaU50YkhTNldUbXc?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/nov/10/us-officials-russia-ukraine-war-abu-dhabi-talks&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&qu